  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">BCECE Mop-Up Revised Counselling Schedule 2025</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2025-09-12T22:11:59+05:30\">September 12, 2025</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">10:11 pm</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://bceceboard.bihar.gov.in/\">Bihar Combined Entrance Competitive Examination Board (BCECEB)</a>, </strong>has been released <strong>Mop-up Counselling\u00a0</strong>on\u00a0<strong>official website</strong> for the <strong>Bihar Combined Entrance Competitive Examination (BCECE) For Admission in Engineering Stream, Medical Stream, Pharmacy Stream and Agriculture Stream. Admission 2025</strong><strong>.</strong>\u00a0<strong>BCECE</strong>\u00a0Application Form will started from\u00a0<strong>09 April 2025</strong>\u00a0&amp; the candidates can Fill the form till\u00a0<strong>18 May 2025.</strong>\u00a0<strong>Exam</strong> was Conducted in <strong>08-09 June 2025.</strong>\u00a0and can be checked through\u00a0<strong>Enrollment number</strong>\u00a0/\u00a0<strong>Registration number</strong>\u00a0/\u00a0<strong>Date of birth</strong>\u00a0by login into the\u00a0<strong>portal.</strong>\u00a0Which has given below.\u00a0</span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n    