"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><b>Click Here</b></span></span></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Apply Online Link</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"><a href=\"https://admissions.nic.in/bihar/applicant/root/OTHome.aspx?enc=k5U5Gp8NR6abhZ8Lld4oWvvSsCkKcG+Kcizck0pVdCvJE10jNAB9fCwdCq9SngLztOhQkgTemQA9XOY99s4R4w==\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><b>Click Here</b></span></span></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Check Date Extend Notice</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://bceceboard.bihar.gov.in/pdf_Adv/ADV_BC25_03.pdf\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong>Click Here</strong></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Download Prospectus</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://bceceboard.bihar.gov.in/pdf_Pros/PROS_BC25.pdf\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong>Click Here</strong></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Check Official Notification</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://bceceboard.bihar.gov.in/pdf_Adv/ADV_BC25_01.pdf\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong>Click Here</strong></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>BCECE Official Website</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://bceceboard.bihar.gov.in/\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong>Click Here</strong></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n\n\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>\u00a0Important Question\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> When will the online application for<strong> BCECE Entrance Online Form 2025</strong> start?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The online application for this exam Has Started On <strong>16 April 2025.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the last date for <strong>BCECE Entrance\u00a0Online Form 2025</strong>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The last date to apply online for this exam is <strong>18 May 2025.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the age limit for <strong>BCECE Entrance</strong><strong>\u00a0Online Form 2025</strong>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The age limit for candidates applying for this exam is as per the <strong>BCECE Entrance</strong>\u00a0rules. For detailed age-related information, refer to the official notification.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the eligibility for <strong>BCECE Entrance</strong><strong>\u00a0Online Form 2025</strong>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer: </strong>Candidates must have passed or appeared in 10+2 with required subjects. For Pharmacy: Physics, Chemistry, and Maths/Biology. For Medical: Physics, Chemistry, Biology, and English. For Agriculture: I.Sc or I.Sc (Agriculture), based on college requirements.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website of <strong>BCECE ?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website of <strong>BCECE </strong>is https://bceceboard.bihar.gov.in</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"BCECE Entrance Exam Result 2025\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-20536 size-full\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"576\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BCECE-Entrance-Exam-Admit-Card-2025.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BCECE-Entrance-Exam-Admit-Card-2025.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BCECE-Entrance-Exam-Admit-Card-2025-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BCECE-Entrance-Exam-Admit-Card-2025-768x432.jpg 768w\" width=\"1024\"/></p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-a1cd0fe1\"><span class=\"gb-headline-text\">Sarkari Result.Com.Cm</span></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=in.qmaths.blackbook&amp;referrer=src%3Dsarkariresult.com.cm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Download English Vocab App</a></strong></p>\n<script async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-9762662687323163\" type=\"b7cf6f707abede73c7cce4dd-text/javascript\"></script>\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" d